          "title": "ComPO: a zeroth-order paradigm for LLM preference alignment",
          "summary": "A comparison-oracle method that extracts directional information from preference pairs without optimizing a differentiable preference loss, with a convergence guarantee for its offline scheme.",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "date": "2026-09-16",
